":{"login":"pippenpaddleopsicopolis","id":12509097,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNTA5MDk3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12509097?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pippenpaddleopsicopolis","html_url":"https://github.com/pippenpaddleopsicopolis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pippenpaddleopsicopolis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pippenpaddleopsicopolis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pippenpaddleopsicopolis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pippenpaddleopsicopolis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pippenpaddleopsicopolis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pippenpaddleopsicopolis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pippenpaddleopsicopolis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pippenpaddleopsicopolis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pippenpaddleopsicopolis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-30T13:53:56Z","updated_at":"2025-04-30T13:53:56Z","body":"I think this is related to this issue https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/49873#issuecomment-867832574","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2842069563/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2876893743","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105925#issuecomment-2876893743","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105925","id":2876893743,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6reeov","user":{"login":"adamscott","id":270928,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MDkyOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270928?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott","html_url":"https://github.com/adamscott","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-13T15:02:22Z","updated_at":"2025-05-13T15:02:22Z","body":"Found the root of the issue.\n\nI can't reproduce on iPad because it uses `TouchEvent`s to scroll. The MacBook Pro trackpad registers as `WheelEvent`.\n\nThe problem lies with the fact that the trackpad polls VERY FAST. For every small pixel traveled (and there's a lot on a MacBook Pro), it triggers on Web browsers a `WheelEvent`. The problem lies with what Godot does with that event.\n\nCurrently, the Godot transposes that event (whether or not it's for a 1 or 100 pixel scroll) to a Godot MouseWheel GUI input event. I imagine that Godot thinks afterwards that the event is for more than one pixel, which explain the hypersensitivity of the MacBook Pro trackpad on the Web.\n\nOn macOS, Godot correctly transposes the trackpad as a Gesture event.\n\nSo, I don't know _yet_ how to fix the issue. Because I don't think I can get the input data otherwise than a `WheelEvent`, and I'm stuck with the mouse wheel interface.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2876893743/reactions","